<BaseLayout
  title="CIRCULA | Expiry-Aware Blockchain Research | Vincenzo Di Perna"
  description="CIRCULA is an SNSF-funded research project exploring expiry and renewal in blockchain systems, hosted at the University of Neuchâtel."
  sideBarActiveItemID="research"
>
  <section class="mb-10">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4"><span class="badge badge-primary">Expected start · 1 February 2027</span><span class="badge badge-outline">SNSF-funded · University of Neuchâtel</span></div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">CIRCULA</h1>
    <p class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Expiry-Aware System Design for Blockchains</p>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">What if a digital resource had a lifetime designed into the system? CIRCULA will investigate how expiry and renewal can be represented and studied in programmable distributed ledgers.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">A new dimension: time</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
      <p>During my PhD, I studied how network topology affects the behaviour and evaluation of blockchain systems. CIRCULA starts from another question: how might a system handle a resource whose validity is meant to end or be renewed?</p>
      <p>For example, a digital entitlement might be valid for a defined period and later require renewal. CIRCULA will study the rules and system implications of lifetimes such as these, including the assumptions and boundaries of different approaches.</p>
      <p>The project will connect an evidence base with formal and executable semantics, prototypes, and controlled evaluation. These are research objectives: the project is expected to begin on 1 February 2027.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Explore the project</h2>
    <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed">CIRCULA is funded by the Swiss National Science Foundation and hosted by the University of Neuchâtel.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://circula.unine.ch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official CIRCULA website</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://data.snf.ch/grants/grant/10010141" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SNSF grant</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/research">More research</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
